    "cols": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-98fdffe29c@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-98fdffe29c@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Jul 27 2022 21:21:08 GMT+0000",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 27 2022 21:21:08 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/columncontrol/cols",
      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_copy_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-98fdffe29c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-9846ac1203@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Nov 16 2021 20:06:59 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">How to submit a request</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Immediately after a qualifying AED&nbsp;is used during an sudden cardiac arrest, download the event data file from your AED.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Complete and submit the following to&nbsp;<b><a href=\"mailto:AEDEvent@Stryker.com\" target=\"_blank\">AEDEvent@Stryker.com</a>:</b></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Event file (.evo for HeartSine AEDs or .pco for LIFEPAK AEDs)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/ems/forward-hearts/resources/forwardhearts_heartsine_customer_event_report.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><b>HeartSine AED customer event form (PDF)</b></a>&nbsp;(with no identifying patient information), or</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><b><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/ems/forward-hearts/resources/forwardhearts_lifepak_customer_event_report.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">LIFEPAK AED customer event form (PDF</a>)&nbsp;</b>(with no identifying patient information)</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">After the event is approved (met qualifications* and the information provided is complete),&nbsp;complete, sign and submit&nbsp;<a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/ems/forward-hearts/resources/forwardhearts_donation_details_form.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forward Hearts Donation Details form (PDF)&nbsp;</b></a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">*QUALIFICATIONS</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: #85458a;\"><b><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Event</span></b></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Event must be a sudden cardiac arrest to qualify. (Event is reviewed by Stryker Clinical team, whose decision is final.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Stryker must receive the original event file (.evo or .pco; pdf file will not be accepted) and Customer Event Report form.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Patient must have survived until hospital admission.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">AED must be used in a non-professional rescue. (Out of hospital, in a workplace or community setting by a layperson rescuer.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Events in nursing homes, long-term care facilities, ambulatory surgery centers, and fire departments are excluded from the program.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><b><span style=\"color: #85458a;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Donation</span></span></b></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><u>Survivor must:</u></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Approve the donation (survivor must participate).</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Submit a signed Donation Details form.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Choose organization for a donation (non-profit or for profit).</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Indicate if they would like publicize donation, with or without their name, or not publicize the donation (not promoted by Stryker or the distributor).<br>\n (Note: If the survivor provides an interview to media about the donation, the donation will no longer be considered anonymous or confidential).</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Indicate AED preference for donation: semi-auto HeartSine samaritan PAD 350P, or fully auto HeartSine samaritan PAD 360P.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Not choose to donate the AED to themselves, another individual, or any healthcare provider or medical professional.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 29 2022 20:22:48 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "rightPadding": "3",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
