          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Survivor: Esley Thorton</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">The most important thing to Esley Thorton is his family. Watch how they each played a role in saving his life with the help of an AED they keep in their kitchen pantry.</span></span></p>\n",
